@intent The mod's three key bindings work in game: the defence configuration screen opens, the summon GUI request is answered, and the sword mode changes
@step arena
gamemode creative
time set day
execute if entity @e[type=!minecraft:player] run kill @e[type=!minecraft:player]
item replace entity @s weapon.mainhand with the_last_sword:the_last_sword

@step defence configuration opens
@key key.the_last_sword.open_defence_config
@expect screen DefenceConfigScreen within 3s
@shot defence-config
@key key.keyboard.escape

@step summon GUI
@wait 1s
@key key.the_last_sword.open_summon_gui
@expect screen Summon within 3s
@shot summon-gui
@key key.keyboard.escape

@step sword mode changes
@wait 1s
@key key.the_last_sword.change_sword_mode
@expect actionbar the_last_sword within 3s
@shot mode-changed
